     3269   MAIN-BLOCK:
     3270   DO ON ERROR   UNDO MAIN-BLOCK, LEAVE MAIN-BLOCK
     3271      ON END-KEY UNDO MAIN-BLOCK, LEAVE MAIN-BLOCK:
     3272   find sch-cli where recid (sch-cli) = int(p-doc-rec) no-error.
     3273   find sch_price-list-type where recid (sch_price-list-type) = int(p-doc-rec) no-error.
